1
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,600
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,760
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,300
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,830
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,270
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:30,110
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,170
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,390
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,910
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,070
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:50,200
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,560
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,320
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:00,480
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,100
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,810
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:07,410
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:08,690
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,470
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,880
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,040
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,560
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:23,720
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:26,980
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:29,040
♪I travel north and south,
witnessing the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:32,520
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:36,120
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,130 --> 00:01:39,600
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,880
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:45,720
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,840
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,000
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 23=

34
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:00,760
You old demon!

35
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:03,120
Why did you do this to me?

36
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:06,280
You...

37
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:08,120
You're still alive?

38
00:02:10,040 --> 00:02:11,120
You old demon.

39
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:12,960
I'll kill you!

40
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:16,840
Such powerful pure yin power.

41
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:19,360
You old fox.

42
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:21,160
You've planned everything.

43
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:23,120
You only knew greed and obsession,

44
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,568
but you never realized

45
00:02:24,569 --> 00:02:26,320
your heart was filled with hatred.

46
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,800
That fully awakened

47
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,040
the pure yin power within him.

48
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,560
You're doomed!

49
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,600
No!

50
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:37,320
My spiritual power!

51
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:52,720
Looks like he won.

52
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,400
Master, you're amazing!

53
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:01,760
That's my brother!

54
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:03,360
- Awesome!
- Amazing!

55
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:06,560
Hey!

56
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,440
Come catch me!

57
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:09,240
Oh! Stop!

58
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,040
Hey!

59
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,400
Stop running!

60
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:14,120
Why won't you leave me alone?

61
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,200
Fine.

62
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:23,360
Since you don't want to go back,

63
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,240
I won't force you.

64
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:27,720
I'll return and report to Heaven

65
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,920
and give my report to the Jade Emperor.

66
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,040
I want to go back.

67
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:34,920
Take me with you.

68
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:36,560
Don't leave me here alone.

69
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,600
The old fox thought
absorbing your spiritual power

70
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:50,960
would make her invincible.

71
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:51,640
But she never expected

72
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:53,720
you'd absorb her hatred instead.

73
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:55,560
Evil always comes back around.

74
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:55,960
Ah!

75
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,840
What are you doing?

76
00:03:58,160 --> 00:03:59,440
What are you trying to do?

77
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,000
You're still alive?

78
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,720
She was destroyed by your attack,

79
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,560
and I took her dragon scale.

80
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:30,240
Even with your power now,

81
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,440
you still can't bring her back.

82
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:36,720
Why don't we join forces?

83
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:38,360
Destroy the Three Realms.

84
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:41,560
Together, we can control life and death.

85
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,960
Don't listen to her.

86
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,840
The little fox would never want

87
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:46,600
to see you become like this.

88
00:05:02,960 --> 00:05:04,720
There are so many people like me
in this world.

89
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,086
They desperately try to protect

90
00:05:08,087 --> 00:05:09,440
what they cherish most,

91
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,000
only to have it cruelly destroyed

92
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:14,200
by people like you who fight for power.

93
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,920
I'll use all my spiritual power

94
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:27,120
to return them to their
happiest moments,

95
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:30,720
and help them reclaim
what they treasure most.

96
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:47,960
Hey!

97
00:05:59,160 --> 00:05:59,960
Watch out!

98
00:06:10,752 --> 00:06:11,952
(Double Happiness)

99
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:14,920
Xiuyuan.

100
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,720
What's wrong?

101
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,360
(Double Happiness)
Yanzhi?

102
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:26,560
I really came back.

103
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,320
My benefactor.

104
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:31,240
Ling'er.

105
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,720
How do you know my name?

106
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:36,800
I don't just know your name.

107
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:37,680
I also know

108
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:39,320
you're the little fox I saved before.

109
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,040
I finally get to see you again.

110
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:42,960
You really wanted to see me?

111
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:44,920
But

112
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:47,560
I heard what that monk said earlier.

113
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,600
It's all my fault.

114
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,120
I made you lose your money.

115
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:52,360
If you don't mind,

116
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:54,560
I'd be willing to...

117
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:55,560
Okay.

118
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:57,560
Really?

119
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,320
But I'm a fox.

120
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:02,120
You're a jiao.

121
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:03,960
We're not even the same species.

122
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:05,640
It's okay.

123
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,760
I don't care.

124
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:09,320
So what do we do now?

125
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:10,760
Go home.

126
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:11,800
Already?

127
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:14,160
I'm not ready yet.

128
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:14,680
Let's go.

129
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:22,680
Forget it.

130
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,160
Bad luck to you.

131
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,760
I'll deal with it after I fill
my stomach.

132
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:36,560
Wait for me.

133
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,960
You're demons too?

134
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:42,400
So it was you.

135
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:44,800
You filthy snake demon!

136
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:46,480
You two-faced snake demon!

137
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:47,480
How dare you trick me!

138
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:48,960
You lied to me!

139
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:50,480
You lied to me!

140
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:52,960
He's so violent... he won't beat me up,
will he?

141
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,700
This Three-Headed Jiao actually

142
00:07:55,700 --> 00:07:57,200
sent me back to this point in time.

143
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:59,440
I need to find a way back quickly.

144
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:02,050
But I haven't regained
my spiritual power yet.

145
00:08:02,050 --> 00:08:04,120
What am I supposed to do?

146
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:06,920
Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

147
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:08,200
Actually,

148
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:11,600
it wasn't the Three-Headed Jiao
who sent you back.

149
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:14,600
Your return to this moment

150
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:17,040
was your own choice.

151
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:21,040
You just called me
Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

152
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:22,120
Yes.

153
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:23,520
So you are...

154
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:25,760
Celestial maiden Yanzhi?

155
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:27,520
Yes.

156
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:29,320
Just now,

157
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:31,080
I was struck by demonic energy

158
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:31,960
that swept over me.

159
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,920
And in an instant,

160
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:35,560
I returned to this moment.

161
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:37,760
I thought

162
00:08:37,800 --> 00:08:39,760
I was facing Li Xiuyuan.

163
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,520
But I never expected

164
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,320
it would be you.

165
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,400
You remember everything

166
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,840
from the past?

167
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,600
Since that's the case,

168
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:59,400
let's figure this out together.

169
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,720
As long as we find
the Three-Headed Jiao,

170
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:02,360
we can go back.

171
00:09:03,400 --> 00:09:05,480
Even if we find him, it won't help.

172
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:08,520
The Three-Headed Jiao from this time
doesn't have enough spiritual power.

173
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:11,120
Only if his future self takes
his spiritual power back.

174
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,120
Otherwise,

175
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:13,800
no matter what we try,

176
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:15,560
we won't be able to leave.

177
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:21,960
Actually,

178
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:24,000
have you ever thought

179
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:27,360
that the two of us returning
to this exact moment

180
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:29,960
might be because Heaven

181
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,100
has deliberately given us

182
00:09:31,100 --> 00:09:32,520
another chance to start over?

183
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,640
I thought I had already

184
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,960
put the past behind me.

185
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:45,160
I never thought I'd return

186
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:47,440
to this very moment.

187
00:09:48,832 --> 00:09:49,752
(Li Xiuyuan.)

188
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:52,320
(You are the reincarnation
of Dragon-Subduing Arhat.)

189
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:54,200
(If you can sever your
worldly attachments,)

190
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:56,000
(and go to Lingyin Temple,)

191
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,700
(you will regain your memories)

192
00:09:57,700 --> 00:09:59,520
(and recover your spiritual power.)

193
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:01,440
(But if you remain attached
to worldly desires,)

194
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:03,560
(you will be punished by Heaven.)

195
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,960
I actually forgot about this.

196
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,400
If you don't become a monk,

197
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,960
you'll surely be punished by Heaven.

198
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:18,240
So what if I don't become a monk?

199
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,000
After all these twists and turns,

200
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:20,840
didn't we still end up back here?

201
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,520
Forget about my destiny.

202
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:24,360
You're right.

203
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:27,280
We don't belong in this time.

204
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,240
Why not take this chance

205
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,280
to do

206
00:10:32,280 --> 00:10:33,920
what we've always wanted to do?

207
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:35,760
Really?

208
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:38,120
The last time I came down
to the mortal realm,

209
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:41,240
there were so many things
I wanted to tell you.

210
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:43,320
But I never got the chance.

211
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:46,240
I have so many things I want
to tell you too.

212
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:50,960
Now we have plenty of time.

213
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:53,960
We can talk slowly, take our time.

214
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:54,960
Hmm.

215
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,760
Let's go.

216
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:04,400
Slow down, my dear.

217
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:07,100
So different species

218
00:11:07,100 --> 00:11:08,120
can still have children together.

219
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:09,000
My dear,

220
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:10,160
stay home and get some rest.

221
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:12,160
I'll go into town to earn some money
and come right back.

222
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:14,120
Don't forget your umbrella, dear.

223
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:15,400
The weather can change without warning.

224
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:17,320
I don't want you getting soaked.

225
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:19,840
Look at all those stars.
How could it rain?

226
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:21,760
Just stay home and rest.

227
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:23,960
Take care of yourself.

228
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,960
Come back soon, dear.

229
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:31,000
I wish I never had to

230
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,320
leave your side, even for a moment.

231
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:38,520
I'm off.

232
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:53,760
I wonder if it'll be a boy or a girl.

233
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:57,160
I hope we'll have twins,
a boy and a girl.

234
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:03,160
Such a devoted little fox.

235
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,120
Ancestor

236
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:09,760
sent me to see you.

237
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:13,440
Later, to appease Her Majesty,

238
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:15,640
the Jade Emperor asked me
to help him write a love letter.

239
00:12:15,800 --> 00:12:16,200
What?

240
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:17,760
You wrote that love letter?

241
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:18,400
Hmm.

242
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:19,880
But when I wrote it,

243
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:21,600
you were the only one on my mind.

244
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,320
You're such a smooth talker.

245
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:24,960
I'm serious.

246
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:30,760
How is it morning already?

247
00:12:30,920 --> 00:12:32,920
We talked all night
without realizing it.

248
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:36,680
Then let's get some rest.

249
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,360
Let's rest for now.

250
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:42,040
- Wait.
- What's wrong?

251
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:43,320
My chest suddenly feels tight.

252
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:44,520
Maybe

253
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:46,120
it's just from staying up too late.

254
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:49,720
(Li Xiuyuan, you refuse to see reason.)

255
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:51,360
(This is your punishment.)

256
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:54,100
If you have a problem, come at me.

257
00:12:54,100 --> 00:12:54,920
Why punish her?

258
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:57,500
(We still need you for what's to come.)

259
00:12:57,500 --> 00:12:59,000
- What?
- (Of course we're punishing her.)

260
00:12:59,440 --> 00:12:59,920
Xiuyuan.

261
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:02,960
Yanzhi!

262
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:03,840
Yanzhi!

263
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:05,280
Yanzhi!

264
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:10,560
How did you find Xuanyuan Tomb?

265
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:13,280
The Ancestor found me.

266
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:15,700
The Ancestor turned you into a human,

267
00:13:15,700 --> 00:13:17,520
but all you did was indulge yourself.

268
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:19,120
This is the price you pay!

269
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:21,560
Darling!

270
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:22,560
I'm back!

271
00:13:30,800 --> 00:13:31,600
Darling!

272
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:35,600
Darling!

273
00:13:37,280 --> 00:13:37,800
Darling!

274
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:39,320
Are you alright?

275
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:41,720
Dear...

276
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:48,480
No!

277
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:51,720
Again!

278
00:13:53,760 --> 00:13:55,080
Why am I back again?

279
00:13:57,920 --> 00:13:58,720
My dear!

280
00:13:59,040 --> 00:14:00,080
Wait for me.

281
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:09,990
(Double Happiness)

282
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:11,520
Again?

283
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:19,790
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

284
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:23,050
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

285
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:26,850
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

286
00:14:26,900 --> 00:14:29,880
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

287
00:14:30,340 --> 00:14:37,090
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

288
00:14:37,110 --> 00:14:40,640
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

289
00:14:47,350 --> 00:14:50,550
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

290
00:14:50,580 --> 00:14:53,810
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

291
00:14:54,100 --> 00:14:57,120
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

292
00:14:57,130 --> 00:14:58,810
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

293
00:14:58,850 --> 00:15:00,730
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

294
00:15:00,770 --> 00:15:02,290
♪I left my wife behind♪

295
00:15:02,430 --> 00:15:03,890
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

296
00:15:03,930 --> 00:15:07,710
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

297
00:15:07,770 --> 00:15:08,850
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

298
00:15:08,860 --> 00:15:10,950
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

299
00:15:10,990 --> 00:15:12,650
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

300
00:15:12,690 --> 00:15:14,520
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

301
00:15:14,550 --> 00:15:17,880
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

302
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:21,150
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

303
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:24,280
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

304
00:15:24,300 --> 00:15:27,650
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

305
00:15:27,700 --> 00:15:31,310
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

306
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:34,660
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

307
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:37,770
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

308
00:15:38,350 --> 00:15:41,400
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

309
00:15:41,420 --> 00:15:44,840
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

310
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:48,400
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

311
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:51,880
♪You're just wasting your time♪

312
00:15:51,930 --> 00:15:54,850
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

313
00:15:54,900 --> 00:15:56,510
♪And I just laugh happily♪

314
00:15:56,540 --> 00:15:59,920
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

